# Update keymap comment diagrams

When you change `bindings` in a `.keymap` file, update that layer's commented key diagram in the same edit. The comments must match the bindings, including empty/`&trans` keys.

Do this before finishing. Do not leave stale labels on Lower, Raise, or any other layer.

```c
// BAD — comment still shows ~ after the binding became RALT
// | SHFT |     |     |     |     |     |  _  |  +  |  {  |  }  | "|" |  ~   |
&kp LSHFT &trans &trans &trans &trans &trans &kp UNDER &kp PLUS &kp LBRC &kp RBRC &kp PIPE &kp RALT

// GOOD — comment matches the binding
// | SHFT |     |     |     |     |     |  _  |  +  |  {  |  }  | "|" | RALT |
&kp LSHFT &trans &trans &trans &trans &trans &kp UNDER &kp PLUS &kp LBRC &kp RBRC &kp PIPE &kp RALT
```
